==Battleground==
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hiroshi Mihara (Enemy)|Hiroshi Mihara]] spawns as the boss after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
*33 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Idol Mihara & Cat (Enemy)|Idol Mihara & Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.67~8 seconds<sup>50f~240f</sup>.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
**6 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10~18 seconds<sup>300f~540f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] are easily able to beat this stage. Even with [[Hiroshi Mihara (Enemy)|Hiroshi Mihara]] being a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemy]], he doesn't have that much HP, taking only 50 to defeat.

==Trivia==
*Hiroshi Mihara Awakens (Easy) and [[Good Effort]] are the only stages where [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] or [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] are not at 100% strength magnification on Level 1 difficulty.

